# Widths of a few letters of RepoRPG_RU.ttf at 100 pixels, written by tools/mkfont.py.
# Before the add-on hands the font to the mod it asks the game for the same widths: if they differ,
# the game did not read this file (it put a system font in its place) and the mod keeps its own font.
# The family name is the one the font is found by when it is installed in the system.
family	RepoRPG RU Menu
# letter <TAB> size <TAB> width
U+0048	100	38
U+0057	100	55
U+0416	100	49
U+0428	100	51
U+0414	100	36
U+044E	100	42
